# Liquify
tool.liquify.name = Guhindura nk'amazi
tool.liquify.description = Sunika, zengurutsa, egeranya cyangwa ubyimbyishe amapikisele ari munsi y'igisigisho kinini — uburyo bwatoranyijwe ni bwo bugena igikorwa. Ihindura ryirundanyiriza mu rusenga maze rigashyirwa ku rwego iyo ryemejwe.
